<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immĕmŏrātus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inm-</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		in-memoratus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unmentioned</i>, <i>not related</i>
				(<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvat immemorata ferentem Ingenuis oculisque
					legi manibusque teneri,</span>”
				<i>not yet related</i>, <i>new</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 19, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nec tu jam metris meis immemoratus eris,</span>”
				<i>unsung</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Parent. 20</span></i>
			.</div>
